The round 12 audit is written to `docs/design/review/design-audit-leash-r12.md`. Grades went down from round 11: B+ to B for design, and AI slop stays at A-.

**Design Score: B**
**AI Slop Score: A-**

| Axis | Score |
|---|---|
| hierarchy | 8.0 |
| primary action | 7.5 |
| typography | 8.5 |
| density/whitespace | 7.5 |
| color | 8.5 |
